{"strongs": "H2347", "word": "חוּס", "translit": "chus", "root": "חום", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "pity, look upon with compassion", "definition": "[ חוּס ] verb pity, look upon with compassion (Aramaic , חוּס pity, spare ; Assyrian —û s, in proper names compare Dl Pr 181 ) — Qal Perfect 3 feminine singular חָסָה Ezek 16:5 , 2 masculine singular חַ֫סְתָּ Jonah 4:10 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יָחוּס Jer 21:7 יָחֹס Ps 72:13 3 feminine singular תָּחוּס Isa 13:18 תָּהוֺס Deut 7:16 + 9 t.( Ges «GKC:72»§ 72 R 4 Bö § 1133 (2)); תָּחֹס Gen 45:20 ; Ezek 9:5 וַתָּ֫חָס 1Sam 24:11 ; Ezek 20:17 1 singular אָחוּס Jer 13:14 + 2 t.; Imperative חוּ֫סָה Joel 2:17 ; Neh 13:22 : — \\ \\ a. of the eye, עין , (לא) תח(ו)ס על the eye shall (not) look with compassion, pity, upon Deut 7:16 ; Deut 13:9 ; Deut 19:13 ; Deut 20:17 לא חסה עָלַיִךְ עין Ezek 16:5 עֵינְכֶם אַלתָּֿחֹס עַלכְּֿלֵיכֶם Gen 45:20 ( R JE ) let not your eye look with regret upon your stuff ; with ellipsis of עַיִן 1Sam 24:11 (but read וָאָחֻס , for וַתָּחָס ᵐ5 ᵑ6 ᵑ7 We Klo Dr ); with ellipsis of על Deut 19:21 ; Deut 25:12 ; Ezek 5:11 ; Ezek 7:9 ; Ezek 8:18 ; Ezek 9:10 (אל) ע֯ל תחס עיני֯כם Ezek 9:5 \\ \\ b. of God חוסה על Neh 13:22 ; Joel 2:17 לא אחוס על נינוה Jonah 4:11 ellipsis of עַל Jer 13:14 ; Ezek 24:14 . \\ \\ c. of man: the Messianic king עלדַּֿל וְאֶבְיוֺן Ps 72:13 he shall have pity on poor and needy , Nebuchadrezzar עליהם (i.e. on Zedekiah and the people) Jer 21:7 Jonah, על הקיקיון Jonah 4:10 . — See also חמל . חוֺף see below II. חפף .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2626')\">BDB2626</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2347')\">H2347</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2625')\">BDB2625</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2627')\">BDB2627</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>חוּס</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>pity, look upon with compassion</highlightword> (Aramaic <placeholder1673/>, <bdbheb>חוּס</bdbheb> <highlight>pity, spare</highlig